<title>USA: Brush Wellman to buy back up to 1 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Brush Wellman to buy back up to 1 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brush Wellman Inc said Tuesday it authorized a plan to repurchase up to one million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said these repurchases would be made in the open market over the next four years.</p>
<p>The stock was up 5/8 at 20-1/2 in early afternoon trading today.  </p>
<p>The company had 16.5 million shares of common stock outstanding as of its April 21 quarterly report.</p>
<p>A statement issued by the company outlining the buyback did not say how many shares are currently outstanding, and company spokesmen were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
